<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title>IRC channel logs</title><style>html {
  background: #fdfdfd;
}

h1 {
  font-weight: 300;
}

h2 {
  font-weight: 200;
}

h3 {
  padding: .5em 0;
  border-top: 3px dotted #ddd;
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

form {
  width: 400px;
  display: flex;
}

input {
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  border-radius: .25em 0 0 .25em;
  border: 1px solid #aaa;
  border-right: 0;
  padding: 0.5em;
}

button {
  display: flex;
  border-radius: 0 .25em .25em 0;
  background-color: #007bff;
  border: 1px solid #007bff;
  padding: .5em;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: white;
}

button:hover {
  background-color: #0069d9;
  border-color: #0062cc;
}

a {
  color: #007bff;
  text-decoration: none;
}

a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}

h4 {
  margin-bottom: .5em;
}

table td {
  padding: 0.75em;
}

table tr:hover {
  background: #eee;
}

.year {
  display: table;
}

.month {
  display: table-cell;
  padding-right: 1em;
}

ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.nick {
  padding-right: 0.6rem;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: right;
  width: 13rem;
  display: table-cell;
}

.nick a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.message {
  display: table-cell;
  padding-left: 0.6rem;
  border-left: 2px solid #333;
}

.notice {
  color: #859900;
  font-style: italic;
}

.line {
  line-height: 1.8rem;
  display: table;
}

#logs {
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
  padding: 1.5rem;
}
</style></head><body><h1>IRC channel logs</h1><h2>2025-01-02.log</h2><p><a href="/bootstrappable">back to list of logs</a></p><div id="logs"><div class="line" id="163835"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#163835" label="[16:38:35]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">hi stikonas_: continued with mes today, and now mescc-tools installed in /usr/local. then mes make:</span></div><div class="line" id="163840"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#163840" label="[16:38:40]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">  GUILEC     module/mescc/compile.scm</span></div><div class="line" id="163843"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#163843" label="[16:38:43]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">make: *** [GNUmakefile:99: build] Error 1</span></div><div class="line" id="163855"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#163855" label="[16:38:55]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">any idea? wrong guile version? i have 3.0.7 installed.</span></div><div class="line" id="164501"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#164501" label="[16:45:01]">&lt;stikonas_&gt;</a></span><span class="message">probably some environmental variables are not exported</span></div><div class="line" id="164557"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#164557" label="[16:45:57]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">I rarely build mes this way (even though I think this is supported and official way)</span></div><div class="line" id="164615"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#164615" label="[16:46:15]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">anyway, try to get more verbose output</span></div><div class="line" id="164650"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#164650" label="[16:46:50]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">maybe &quot;make V=s&quot;</span></div><div class="line" id="164700"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#164700" label="[16:47:00]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">ok</span></div><div class="line" id="164727"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#164727" label="[16:47:27]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">trace command not found</span></div><div class="line" id="164844"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#164844" label="[16:48:44]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">well, this is a developer build, not bootstrappable build</span></div><div class="line" id="164856"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#164856" label="[16:48:56]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">just followed the readme</span></div><div class="line" id="164938"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#164938" label="[16:49:38]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">ah, separate INSTALL file, let me go after that</span></div><div class="line" id="165006"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#165006" label="[16:50:06]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">I usually build using kaem script (kaem.run)</span></div><div class="line" id="165021"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#165021" label="[16:50:21]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">seems i definitately need nyacc</span></div><div class="line" id="165031"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#165031" label="[16:50:31]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">that's needed to rebuild mes</span></div><div class="line" id="165037"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#165037" label="[16:50:37]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">(with mescc)</span></div><div class="line" id="165045"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#165045" label="[16:50:45]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">mes itself does not need nyacc</span></div><div class="line" id="165053"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#165053" label="[16:50:53]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">it's mescc that uses nyacc</span></div><div class="line" id="165109"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#165109" label="[16:51:09]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">yeah, ok, that's fine</span></div><div class="line" id="165115"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#165115" label="[16:51:15]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">and path to nyacc should be added to GUILE_LOAD_PATH</span></div><div class="line" id="165206"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#165206" label="[16:52:06]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">ok, thanks</span></div><div class="line" id="165730"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#165730" label="[16:57:30]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">i did the nyacc install into /usr/local, how should GUILE_LOAD_PATH then look like?</span></div><div class="line" id="165807"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#165807" label="[16:58:07]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">there is now a /usr/local/lib/guile/3.0/site-ccache/nyacc directory</span></div><div class="line" id="172724"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#172724" label="[17:27:24]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">I guess /usr/local/lib/guile/3.0/site-ccache/nyacc:/path/to/mes/module:/path/to/mes/mes/module</span></div><br /></div></body></html>